 how:[
  ['Read the clipart with its transparency','Most clipart is a PNG with a transparent background. The alpha channel is kept so the area around the artwork never becomes a shape.','Canvas · alpha','alpha'],
  ['Separate fills from outlines','Clipart combines black outlines with flat fills. Eight to twelve colors give each its own layer, and anti-aliased pixels between them are snapped away.','Median cut · edge snapping','pal'],
  ['Trace each layer','Every layer is outlined at sub-pixel accuracy, so thick outlines and small highlights stay in place.','Marching squares','wire'],
  ['Render stacked layers','Layers are stacked in order so there are no gaps between outline and fill, then written as compact SVG paths.','Bézier fit','vec']],
 why:['What is special about clipart',[['Outline and fill layers','The outline is its own path, so you can thicken, recolor or remove it.'],['Transparent PNG','Transparency is kept, so there is no white box around the artwork.'],['Halo fringes','Pale rings around dark outlines are merged by Remove specks and by reducing colors.']]],
 pdef:'Four steps convert clipart to SVG. A transparent PNG source gives the cleanest edges.',
